# Generated data. Since the move to the VPS the worker writes it straight to a
# volume (deploy/README.md); it no longer goes through git. Locally:
# ./deploy/pull-data.sh, or run the pipeline.
/data/
webapp/public/data/
webapp/public/municipalities.json

# Analysis inputs: large raw downloads, all regenerable via their fetch script.
# The derived per-PC4 / per-municipality artefacts they feed ARE committed.
data/cbs/*.gpkg
data/cbs/*.zip
data/cbs/*.xlsx
data/ov/*.json
data/ov/*.zip
data/analysis_points.geojson

# Nationwide POI layers are inputs to split_pois_by_municipality.py only —
# 40 MB, of which bushaltes alone is 20 MB. The per-municipality bundles the
# webapp actually loads are committed, as is poi/index.json.
webapp/public/data/poi/*.geojson
